uote it as a machined-from-billet part in 6061-T6 instead. The true positio=
n callout of 0.005&quot; on the mounting holes is extremely tight for a cas=
ting. Machined from billet, it's very achievable for us.<br><br>2. The over=
all geometry is straightforward - I can program this for our Haas VF-4 in 2=
